"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1391863906434552&title=%09From+young+adults+and+growing+families+to+our+seniors%2C+Michelle+Embree+Ku+knows+what+matters+to+Newtown+because+she+listens.+Michelle+is+ready+to+fight+for+lower+energy%2C+and+healthcare+costs%2C+bring+more+state+funding+home%2C+and+help+reduce+local+property+taxes.+Let%E2%80%99s+send+a+proven+advocate+to+Hartford+on+Election+Day%21+%F0%9F%97%B3%EF%B8%8F%23MichelleEmbreeKu+%23NewtownCommunity+%23CTDems+%23KuForYou+%23106thDistrict+%23Newtown+%23newtownct+%23Connecticut+%09%09",
